This design has been tweaked for a little better
F/R over band 14.0 to 14.35 MHz. The element taper
is that of the Hy-Gain 204BA. Note that the 2.140"
o.d. section is modeling the element clamp and boom,
and that the length of the 1.250" section is
shortened by the length of the 2.140" section.

This design was optimized for F/R over band > 20 dB,
and SWR over the band < 2:1, with a mid-band free-
space gain of 8.3 dBi. Torque compensator is 2.5" OD 
PVC, 47 " long, mounted 12" behind Director 3, on flat 
metal plate with U-bolts.
